    "font" : "Roboto-Regular",
    "font size" : 11.495,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Any claim not registered within said period shall be considered waived and the use of the water deemed abandoned, and the water shall thereupon be available for disposition as unappropriated waters in accordance with the provisions of this Code."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 20,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 22.667, 520.667, 589.0, 558.667 ],
    "font" : "Roboto-Regular",
    "font size" : 11.495,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "ARTICLE 96. No vested or acquired right to the use of water can arise from acts or omissions which are against the law or which infringe upon the rights of others."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 21,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 22.333, 444.667, 589.333, 502.333 ],
    "font" : "Roboto-Regular",
    "font size" : 11.495,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "ARTICLE 97. Acts and contracts under the regime of old laws, if they are valid in accordance therewith, shall be respected, subject to the limitations established in this Code. Any modi cation or extension of these acts and contracts after the promulgation of this Code, shall be subject to the provisions hereof."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 22,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 23.0, 389.333, 589.0, 427.0 ],
    "font" : "Roboto-Regular",
    "font size" : 11.495,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "ARTICLE 98. Interim rules and regulations promulgated by the Council shall continue to have binding force and effect, when not in con ict with the provisions of this Code."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 23,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 23.333, 333.0, 589.333, 371.667 ],
    "font" : "Roboto-Regular",
    "font size" : 11.495,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "ARTICLE 99. If any provision or part of this Code, or the application thereof to any person or circumstance, is declared unconstitutional or invalid for any reason, the other provisions or parts therein shall not be affected."
